<p>Heya</p>
<p>Firstly, I want to focus on your central narrative/&quot;Full Idea Summary:&quot;. This section is meant to show off the story you will tell with your anomaly and how you will make it interesting. Merely describing the anomaly doesn't show its potential or the narrative backing it up.</p>
<p>Second, the anomaly has an interesting premise, however, you seem to not go anywhere with it. A ghost that can cook healing stew is great, but why does it do this, how does it, what is the reason behind it?</p>
<p>I would suggest reading through up to date SCPs and trying to construct a bigger narrative for your idea, as it currently seems to lack one.</p>
<p>Hope this helped</p>

